er graphic generation and visual processing suite for De"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"epSeek Harness. It equips autonomous agents with an extensible set of tools for image generation, tr"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ansformation, background removal, upscaling, vectorization, multi-reference blending, and quality in"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"spection across 8 generative backends."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 🚀 What's New in v0.10.7 (#197)\n* **Robust Error Formatting**: completely prevents `[object Objec"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"t]` from appearing in provider refusal chains, extracting deep `.message`, `.detail`, and `.error` o"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"bjects cleanly.\n* **Deduplicated Provider Prefixes**: eliminates redundant `codex: codex: ...` prefi"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"xes.\n* **FAL Credential Aliasing**: seamless fallback between `FAL_API_KEY` and `FAL_KEY` in credent"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"ials and environment.\n* **Subscription Aspect Ratio Mapping**: maps aspect ratios (`16:9`, `3:2`, `9"},{"id":"p7s6","text":":16`, `2:3`) to appropriate subscription dimensions (`1536x1024` / `1024x1536`) instead of falling b"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ack to default square `1024x1024`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### 🚀 What's New in v0.10.16\n* **Safe Attachment Service Fallback (#214)**: Added graceful fallback "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"handling in `saveAttachmentSafe` across all 8 visual tools (`generate_image`, variations, `remove_ba"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"ckground`, `upscale_image`, `blend_images`, etc.). When running in headless CLI mode or when the att"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"achment store is unavailable, outputs are safely written to disk with full file paths and data refer"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"ences rather than crashing tool execution.\n* **HTTP Image Endpoint Strict Validation**: Hardened `/d"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"sh-image-gen/image` route against malformed or NaN parameters (`b`, `w`, `h`), cleanly responding wi"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"th HTTP 400 or 404 without leaking internal system traces.