0","text":"as (#328)**: In-chat masking overlay with aspect ratio auto-detection, adjustable brush/eraser, and "},{"id":"p9s11","text":"direct prompt dispatch.\n* **Live Progress Stream (#329)**: Real-time progress bar, stage indicators,"},{"id":"p9s12","text":" and denoising step counters in `FalImageCard`."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 🚀 What's New in v0.11.9\n* **ComfyUI Local Backend Payload Fix (#322, GitHub #7)**: Eliminated re"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"dundant nesting in `lib/providers/backends/local.js` that wrapped workflows as `{ prompt: { prompt: "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"workflowGraph } }`, resolving `missing_node_type: Node 'ID #prompt' has no class_type` HTTP 400 erro"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"rs during local ComfyUI generations. Added node shape validation before submission."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 🚀 What's New in v0.11.8\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### 🚀 What's New in v0.10.15\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["output_not_object","output_not_object","finish_reason"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
